{"summary":"Create peaceful ecosystems in this relaxing, nature-inspired puzzle game","description":"Preserve is free to download with no ads. In-app purchases are required to unlock the full experience. \n\nRestore the wild. One tile at a time.\n\nPreserve is a peaceful puzzle game that lets you build entire ecosystems through clever placement of flora and fauna cards. Whether you're growing a forest, cultivating a wetland, or balancing food chains in a meadow, your decisions shape how each biome evolves.\n\nEnjoy multiple game modes tailored to your mood—complete challenges in Puzzle mode, build freely in Creative, or find balance in classic mode. With its serene soundtrack, charming visuals, and relaxing yet rewarding gameplay loop, Preserve is a unique digital escape for the minds.\n\n- Grow living biomes by matching flora and fauna synergies  \n- Multiple gameplay modes: Puzzle, Classic and Creative\n- Unlock natural wonders and discover secret patterns  \n- Soothing visuals and relaxing soundtrack  \n- Fully offline, no ads.\n\nRelax. Reconnect. Rewild the world.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$2.99 - $6.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nXFLLWSMleI?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qS9jWw8SKSbtreBuJPmalT8sS7iXGqZATU4i3prOrR7CCXf7W3kDM3fq0vS0feJuRrfwDhKQY_fT0DRu9ImHtQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/E_Xqfrtae_qm-OZtKP8ETJOTV-kyDSdo7vPdfKKR85lkYv8d9CBSkFlvFQ-N5bKvqEyjq4DRwIXYQWyqokelmMQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/n1-eunv2hcD_IfQhBfoqh30aDgMtsjDfRQ0Yk6AEmZBzhIYFL_aHD91vHfsLpoRZuvnyZLHw8SwxS0dfGZPLkQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gRwnq70dwBuNxh_m7yeLj1JxzPRoF_U6KkNWWEwUpHQF5qA_RJ7q5dPsaq0l9UlbnBWZNloh0srmD4z7UjjMSA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S-kk5k2dZsX_xqU1gy-mZIB9_PJuiycV3EDqPyIsGEa2UuXclgIZGBbQij6Mpgeur2oBX6eJ7ntMAihFwcmlzQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MrbxmddHM-OOf6rQdWwreEMwGl3YwCAl-NwK-20glGcfmZlkoDWZYG